<title>INDIA: Indian Feb foodgrains stocks 17.25 mln tonnes.</title>
<headline>Indian Feb foodgrains stocks 17.25 mln tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian foodgrains stocks fell to 17.25 million tonnes in February from 18.60 million tonnes in Januray, and against 26.12 million tonnes in February last year, the government said on Friday.</p>
<p>    FOODGRAINS STOCKS    Feb 97   Jan 97   Feb 96</p>
<p>    Rice		     13.56    13.52     16.19</p>
<p>    Wheat		     3.69     5.08	9.93</p>
<p>    Total		    17.25    18.60     26.12</p>
<p>Note - Figures are in millions of tonnes and preliminary.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
